# Question 1

### Display every employee along with the highest salary in their department using `LAST_VALUE()`.

```sql id="3j8p0f"
SELECT *,
       LAST_VALUE(Salary) OVER(
           PARTITION BY Department
           ORDER BY Salary ASC
           ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING
                    AND UNBOUNDED FOLLOWING
       ) AS highest_salary
FROM Employees;
```

### Logic

```text
ASC:
50000 → 60000 → 70000

LAST_VALUE:
70000
```

