# Question 2

### Display every employee along with the name of the lowest-paid employee in their department using `LAST_VALUE()`.

```sql id="x7b2nq"
SELECT *,
       LAST_VALUE(Name) OVER(
           PARTITION BY Department
           ORDER BY Salary DESC
           ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING
                    AND UNBOUNDED FOLLOWING
       ) AS lowest_paid_employee
FROM Employees;
```

### Logic

```text
DESC:
70000 → 60000 → 50000

LAST_VALUE(Name):
John
```

